sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    Alice->>John: Hello John, how are you?
    loop Every minute
        John-->>Alice: Great!
    end
    alt is sick
        Bob->>Alice: Not so good :(
    else is well
        Bob->>Alice: Feeling fresh like a daisy
    end
    opt Extra response
        Bob->>Alice: Thanks for asking
    end
    par Alice to Bob
        Alice->>Bob: Hello guys!
    and Alice to John
        Alice->>John: Hello guys!
    end
    critical Connect
        John-->Bob: connect
    option Timeout
        John-->John: Log error
    end
    break when it fails
        Bob-->Alice: show failure
    end
    rect rgba(0, 0, 255, .1)
        Alice->>+John: Inside a rect
        John-->>-Alice: Back
    end
